{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>33歲日本前AV女優濱崎真緒近期參演HOY TV處境喜劇《你的保安李寶安》，全程挑戰廣東話演出瞬間成為全城熱話。網友對這位老師背景感到好奇！</p>\n<h2>濱崎真緒參演《你的保安李寶安》挑戰廣東話</h2>\n<p>濱崎真緒在HOY TV處境喜劇《你的保安李寶安》中驚喜亮相，拋開過往性感形象全程以廣東話進行演出，破格表現令大批觀眾刮目相看。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179432112811671964_10306271586af32ae93a605.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-879EP10XWalletHOY-YouTube-2’19”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179432112811671964_10306271586af32ae93a605.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>濱崎真緒在HOY TV處境喜劇《你的保安李寶安》中驚喜亮相！（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>告別13年女優生涯轉型性感DJ</h2>\n<p>回顧長達13年成人片生涯，濱崎真緒自2012年正式出道以來參演作品超過2,000部，更曾獲成人放送大賞女演員獎提名。光鮮背後卻充滿辛酸，她曾在節目透露拍攝時被要求單日喝下高達10公升水分，甚至在戶外被綁樹上遇上地震時遭劇組人員遺留長達十多分鐘。種種非人經歷促使她在2024年台北國際成人展上拋出震撼彈宣布引退，並以藝名DJ Mao全力發展事業，她曾獲外國網站評選為世界最性感DJ第11名。</p>\n<h2>濱崎真緒成為真正香港居民</h2>\n<p>她自從全面轉移陣地來港發展DJ事業後，初期因為工作簽證限制而遇上不少阻滯，每隔3至4天便要經深圳出入境以更新簽證。為了縮短通勤時間並方便往返內地，她索性在元朗租屋居住成為當區街坊，每日奔波勞碌只為能在本地演藝圈穩佔一席位。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>終於在今年5月11日迎來好消息，正式領取香港居民身份證成為新香港人。她難掩激動情緒，隨即在社交平台曬出這張得來不易身份證與粉絲分享喜悅，不過為保障私隱將證件上真實姓名遮蓋。面對網民紛紛猜測其本名，她親自留言並以廣東話幽默回應稱自己叫做「進擊的海膽」，與粉絲在留言區頻繁互動。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚態度極專業</h2>\n<p>這次參演本地劇集消息一出，各大討論區隨即湧現大量留言，網民對她轉型後努力給予高度評價。不少觀眾留言表示「估唔到佢廣東話講得咁好」、「由元朗街坊變香港人真係好勵志」、「你超正，想係保安再見到你」、「你同麥沛東幾好笑」、「好好看! 演得很好」</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179432113435414145_17740413726af32aeea59a3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179432113435414145_17740413726af32aeea59a3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>網友對這位老師背景感到好奇！（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179396139680782155_6217869146aedadb534d04.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"7.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179396139680782155_6217869146aedadb534d04.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178426304849954525_14344936686a59b18937d06.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"濱崎真緒 前av女優 （圖片來源：FB@浜崎真緒）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178426304849954525_14344936686a59b18937d06.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：FB@浜崎真緒）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17842630712179372_12029417936a59b1a0c70a1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"濱崎真緒 前av女優 （圖片來源：FB@浜崎真緒）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17842630712179372_12029417936a59b1a0c70a1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：FB@浜崎真緒）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178426305301193475_20071268606a59b18d77340.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"濱崎真緒 前av女優 （圖片來源：FB@浜崎真緒）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178426305301193475_20071268606a59b18d77340.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：FB@浜崎真緒）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178524894711818368_13234999966a68bcb3784dd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"750085090_1799730371204428_3697535843871882510_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178524894711818368_13234999966a68bcb3784dd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：濱崎真緒@Facebook）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17851654905167766_3694960386a6776b2e1e1d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17851654905167766_3694960386a6776b2e1e1d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>自兩年前宣布從成人影視圈引退後，她成功轉型為DJ並積極拓展亞洲市場。（圖片來源：浜崎真緒@Facebook）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178516548211970776_5919115596a6776aabc93e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178516548211970776_5919115596a6776aabc93e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>前AV女優濱崎真緒熱愛香港！（圖片來源：浜崎真緒@Facebook）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T14:41:55.912493+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1208,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:32:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:35:29.840016+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:35:29.840016+00:00","content_hash":"56049cd055c7236ca024742d177b322ec592f140c64c69f066a7c831d961751f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}